    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "0D384DD6F5849F51",
      "text": "Quelle idée de m’inviter dans un bâtiment\\naussi récent ! Tu manques pas de culot ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "0D384CD6F5849D9E",
      "text": "Pour tout te dire, ça m’emballe pas vraiment,\\nton histoire...\\c\\nMais comme je suis d’humeur généreuse,\\nje suis venue t’aider malgré tout ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "0D384BD6F5849BEB",
      "text": "Donc, pour faire court... tu m’en dois une !\\nHé hé hé ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "0D384AD6F5849A38",
      "text": "Pour qu’on soit quittes, tu vas devoir me rendre\\nservice à ton tour ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "57AE81059636D3ED",
      "text": "Oh non... !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "57AE7E059636CED4",
      "text": "D’accord !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "0D3850D6F584A46A",
      "text": "C’est toi qui m’as appelée, donc tu peux\\nt’en prendre qu’à toi-même !\\c\\nQui sème le vent récolte la tempête ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "FB5565433062B998",
      "text": "Tiens ? Je te trouve bien obéissant[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e...\\nC’est parfait, ça m’arrange ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "0D3851D6F584A61D",
      "text": "Bien... Qu’est-ce que je vais te demander\\nde faire, maintenant que t’es à mon service ?\\r\\nCe qui est sûr, c’est que je vais bien m’amuser ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "666D0BF03CD5C25E",
      "text": "Oh, c’est toi ?\\nComment ça va depuis l’autre jour ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "666D0CF03CD5C411",
      "text": "La dernière fois, j’étais pas enchantée d’être là,\\nmais je me suis souvenue qu’on était à Unys !\\c\\nC’est une région riche en trésors et en vestiges\\ndu passé qui attendent que d’être découverts ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "666D09F03CD5BEF8",
      "text": "Et parmi ces vestiges, ce sont des ruines\\nsous-marines qui sommeillent au fond de\\r\\nl’océan qui piquent le plus ma curiosité ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "666D0AF03CD5C0AB",
      "text": "En plus, ici, j’ai pas le proviseur qui me colle\\naux basques, donc ça m’arrange ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "666D0FF03CD5C92A",
      "text": "Donc, moi et mes Pokémon, on va aller piquer\\nune petite tête tout à l’heure, histoire d’explorer\\r\\ntout ça ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "2FC3C3870821A010",
      "text": "Quel beau programme !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "2FC3C6870821A529",
      "text": "Faites attention à vous !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "666D10F03CD5CADD",
      "text": "Hé hé hé ! Tu l’as dit !\\c\\nL’archéologie et les frissons qui vont avec\\nsont mes trésors les plus chers ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp02_05b",
      "hash64": "E11E87375F47828D",
      "text": "Hé hé hé, t’inquiète Floette !\\c\\nSi je devais un jour disparaître au beau milieu\\nde ruines et de reliques, ce serait pour moi\\r\\nla meilleure manière de partir.[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "8F3801E4F1FB6D2F",
      "text": "Ah... C’est toi... ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "8C4F417AD5A90CCB",
      "text": "Qu’y a-t-il ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "8C4F427AD5A90E7E",
      "text": "Ça ne va pas ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "8F3800E4F1FB6B7C",
      "text": "Ça se voit pas ? Toutes ces émotions intenses\\nm’ont un peu vidée de mon énergie ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "5794A3072E3703FA",
      "text": "Hé hé hé, si ! Je dirais même que ça va très\\nbien ! Je suis juste un poil fatiguée après\\r\\ntoutes ces émotions intenses ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "8F3803E4F1FB7095",
      "text": "Hier, je suis allée explorer les ruines sous-marines,\\naccompagnée de mon Luminéon...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "8F3802E4F1FB6EE2",
      "text": "C’était vraiment... époustouflant ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "8F37FDE4F1FB6663",
      "text": "Ces pièges pour tenir à l’écart les indésirables...\\net ces murs recouverts de textes anciens ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "8F37FCE4F1FB64B0",
      "text": "J’ai pu comparer mes connaissances à celles\\nde nos ancêtres... C’était une expérience aussi\\r\\nagréable qu’enrichissante ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "8F37FFE4F1FB69C9",
      "text": "Ce serait du gâchis d’aller directement\\ndans la partie la plus reculée des ruines.\\r\\nJe compte bien les explorer petit à petit ![VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "3D5AF8BE8D788069",
      "text": "Tiens, d’ailleurs, tant que j’y pense !\\nIl m’est venu une idée...[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "3D5AF7BE8D787EB6",
      "text": "T’es bien devenu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse, pas vrai ?\\c\\nTu voudrais pas faire un échange de Pokémon\\navec moi ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0027"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_history_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "3D5AF6BE8D787D03",
      "text": "Je me dis que n’importe lequel de tes Pokémon\\nme sera forcément d’une grande aide.\\c\\nDe mon côté, je peux te proposer un Mordudor.\\nÇa t’irait ?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
